From: Matheus Biolowons <30575805+Ashu11-A@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 09:53:01 -0300
Subject: i18n: registra os idiomas suportados pelo painel em config/app.php

Description:
Registra o mapa de locales suportados em config/app.php, incluindo pt-BR
(Português do Brasil) como tradução mantida pelo overlay Jexactyl-BR ao lado
do idioma padrão en (English). Chaves ausentes no catálogo ativo utilizam
automaticamente o fallback_locale configurado.

Origin: vendor
Forwarded: not-needed
Applied-Upstream: no
Last-Update: 2026-10-27
Signed-off-by: Matheus Biolowons <30575805+Ashu11-A@users.noreply.github.com>

---

diff --git a/config/app.php b/config/app.php
index 5ad102bf6..aee086bb0 100644
--- a/config/app.php
+++ b/config/app.php
@@ -150,6 +150,22 @@ return [
 
     'fallback_locale' => 'en',
 
+    /*
+    |--------------------------------------------------------------------------
+    | Supported Locales
+    |--------------------------------------------------------------------------
+    |
+    | Locales offered by the panel. The Brazilian Portuguese translation is
+    | maintained by the Jexactyl-BR overlay and falls back to "en" whenever a
+    | key is missing from the translation file.
+    |
+    */
+
+    'locales' => [
+        'en' => 'English',
+        'pt-BR' => 'Português (Brasil)',
+    ],
+
     /*
     |--------------------------------------------------------------------------
     | Encryption Key
